OL,3,GNEWSACity walls 'tap to donate' raises
OL,4,Anearly #9,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trial scheme raising money towards
OL,7,Fthe conservation of York's city walls
OL,8,Fhas raised nearly #9,000 in its first
OL,9,Fyear, figures reveal.
OL,11,F'Tap to donate' points, installed at
OL,12,FBootham Bar last September at a cost of
OL,13,F#10,000, allow users to give money
OL,14,Ftowards stonemasonry maintenance works.
OL,16,FAccording to council figures obtained
OL,17,Fthrough a freedom of information
OL,18,Frequest by the Local Democracy
OL,19,FReporting Service, #8,136 has been
OL,20,Fraised via donation points and #530 has
OL,21,Fbeen donated online.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
